    <statement><p>For each surface, decide whether it could be a bowl, a plate, or neither.
Consider a plate to be any fairly flat surface and a bowl to be anything 
that could hold water, assuming the positive z-axis is up.</p>
<p><ol>
<li>
<p><m>z = 1 - x^2 - y^2</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>z = x^2 + y^2</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>z = - \sqrt{ 4 - x^2 - y^2 }</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>z = 5</m></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><m>x + y + z = 4</m></p>
</li>
</ol></p>
</statement>
